lters.com','2015-01-27 00:49:27'),(216,'','0.5 acres Prime land for sale in Runda, Kshs. 28M. Contact info@neptuneshelters.com','2015-01-27 00:49:55'),(217,'','4 bdrm rental Double Storey House  in Runda Kshs. 250,000 pm. Contact info@neptuneshelters.com','2015-01-27 00:50:17'),(218,'ISLAMQ','He who is deprived of gentleness is deprived of good','2015-01-28 04:02:42'),(219,'ISLAMQ','In the valley, on the mountain, I beheld only God. In hardship I saw Him by my side. In ease and well-being I beheld only God.','2015-01-28 04:06:10'),(220,'ISLAMQ','A true Muslim is the one who does not defame or abuse others; but the truly righteous becomes a refuge for humankind, their lives and their properties.','2015-01-28 04:21:32'),(221,'ISLAMQ','When your heart is dark as iron, steadily polish yourself that the heart may become a mirror, a beautiful shine reflecting from within.','2015-01-28 04:26:09'),(222,'ISLAMQ','When you see the misfortune of your brother, do not rejoice, for Allah may save him and afflict you with the same misfortune','2015-01-28 04:35:18'),(223,'ISLAMQ','During prayer I give myself over to the Lord .The window of my soul opens wide and the Book of God comes to view To fill my house with grace and light.','2015-01-28 04:37:08'),(224,'ISLAMQ','Turn to Allah and implore forgiveness. For indeed Allah is Most Forgiving and Merciful.','2015-01-28 04:39:07'),(225,'ISLAMQ','O you who believe! Strengthen yourselves with resolution and prayer. Indeed Allah is with those who persevere in adversity.','2015-01-28 04:39:50'),(226,'ISLAMQ','But Allah doth call to the Home of Peace: He doth guide whom He pleaseth to a way that is straight.','2015-01-28 04:40:46'),(227,'ISLAMQ','Allah promised forgiveness and an immense reward to those who believe and remain righteous.','2015-01-28 04:47:37'),(228,'VALENTINE','I Thought I’d never find someone to love me the way I needed to be loved then you came in my life & showed me what true love really is','2015-01-28 15:27:05'),(229,'VALENTINE','Girl: Why my name is always on your Facebook status in every 2 minutes? Boy: Facebook keeps asking me what\'s on my mind. And honestly, it\'s always you','2015-01-28 15:27:48'),(230,'VALENTINE','Can I take your photo? Girl: what for? Boy: so that I can show Santa Claus what I want for Christmas','2015-01-28 15:28:14'),(231,'VALENTINE','Anyone Can Make You Smile, Many People Can Make You Cry, but It Takes Someone Really Special to Make You Smile With Tears in Your Eyes','2015-01-28 15:28:56'),(232,'VALENTINE','The Next Girl I’ll ever love will be our Daughter','2015-01-28 15:29:21'),(233,'VALENTINE','My 1 hand is enough 2 fight against the world if you hold the another one','2015-01-28 15:30:09'),(234,'VALENTINE','Last night I was thinking of you, a tear rolled out \'\'Why?\'\' I can\'t find any space for me coz there\'s someone so beautiful there','2015-01-28 15:30:31'),(235,'VALENTINE','You Asked Me if I Love You More Or My Life I Said My Life You Walked Away With Tears in Your Eyes without Knowing You Are My Life','2015-01-28 15:30:53'),(236,'VALENTINE','Love warms your soul and makes life easy, enjoyable and worthwhile','2015-01-28 15:31:13'),(237,'VALENTINE','Love is a positive state of being so powerful that it can overshadow even the dreariest of circumstances','2015-01-28 15:31:33'),(238,'VALENTINE','You are my love from now till death I thank stars above for your faithfulness','2015-01-28 15:32:36'),(239,'VALENTINE','My heart is broken my love is your token to find all my charms Hold me in your arms and never let me go','2015-01-28 15:32:54'),(240,'VALENTINE','Don\'t pass up your chance, we can dine and dance. We can roam the town until the sun goes down','2015-01-28 15:33:14'),(241,'VALENTINE','Love is true. Love is golden. Love for you my baibe','2015-01-28 15:33:38'),(242,'VALENTINE','Your love is like the ocean, vast, spacious and deep. You have given me your potion of love that I must keep','2015-01-28 15:34:05'),(243,'VALENTINE','Your love is so pure, Whitest of whites. Teddy bear\'s fur and cleanest of night','2015-01-28 15:34:22'),(244,'VALENTINE','It is All Hearts Day with flowers all around. Please tell me; just say you will always be around','2015-01-28 15:34:41'),(245,'VALENTINE','All Hearts Day is good even better if you would be my steady date and forever soul mate','2015-01-28 15:35:06'),(246,'VALENTINE','To see you is to love you, you have my heart, so don\'t tear it apart','2015-01-28 15:35:35'),(247,'VALENTINE','As fish are to the sea so you are to me','2015-01-28 15:36:03'),(248,'VALENTINE','If I had to choose whether to breathe or to love you, I would use my last breath to tell you that... I love you','2015-01-28 15:56:39'),(249,'VALENTINE','Looking back, I have this to regret, that too often when I loved, I did not say so.','2015-01-28 15:57:34'),(250,'VALENTINE','I love you, not only for what you are, but for what I am when I am with you.','2015-01-28 15:57:55'),(251,'VALENTINE','As you look back upon your life, the moments when you have really lived, are the moments when you have done things in the spirit of love','2015-01-28 15:58:32'),(252,'VALENTINE','Love is, above all, the gift of oneself','2015-01-28 15:58:50'),(253,'VALENTINE','You never lose by loving. You always lose by holding back.','2015-01-28 15:59:30'),(254,'VALENTINE','You come to love not by finding the perfect person, but by seeing an imperfect person perfectly','2015-01-28 15:59:50'),(255,'VALENTINE','It\'s easy to fall in love. The hard part is finding someone to catch you.','2015-01-28 16:00:13'),(256,'VALENTINE','Love doesn\'t make the world go round; it just makes the ride worthwhile','2015-01-28 16:00:41'),(257,'VALENTINE','I have had a really bad day and it always makes me feel better to see a pretty girl smile. So would you smile for me?','2015-01-28 16:01:03'),(258,'VALENTINE','Is that love I see in your eyes, or merely a reflection of mine?','2015-01-28 16:01:22'),(259,'VALENTINE','From A to Z all that really matters is U and I.','2015-01-28 16:02:04'),(260,'VALENTINE','Some say there are more. Some say everything in life is a wonder. But to me, there is only one... You!','2015-01-28 16:02:23'),(261,'VALENTINE','When I look in the mirror all I can see is your love','2015-01-28 16:02:42'),(262,'VALENTINE','Tears can be more special than smiles, because smiles can be given to anyone, but tears are only shed for the one we love','2015-01-28 16:03:07'),(263,'VALENTINE','A love that is denied only goes stronger','2015-01-28 16:04:00'),(264,'VALENTINE','Do you have a map? Because I just keep getting lost in your eyes','2015-01-28 16:04:25'),(265,'VALENTINE','If kisses were raindrops, I would send you a thunderstorm','2015-01-28 16:04:49'),(266,'VALENTINE','Love is like an hour glass, the brain empties as the heart fills up','2015-01-28 16:05:16'),(267,'VALENTINE','Believe me, there is no room left in my heart for another girl','2015-01-28 16:05:33'),(268,'VALENTINE','Loving someone isn\'t when you picture yourself with them; it\'s realizing that you can\'t live without them','2015-01-28 16:05:47'),(269,'VALENTINE','Meeting you was fate, becoming your friend was a choice, but falling in love with you was beyond my control','2015-01-28 16:06:04'),(270,'VALENTINE','Did the sun come out or did you just smile at me?','2015-01-28 16:06:48'),(271,'MCHONG','Naskia ati we ni zuzu ulipaint aerial ya tv yako ndio uone coloured','2015-01-28 16:19:28'),(272,'MCHONG','Uko na kichwa biggy ukingia daro mode anakushow hakuna group work','2015-01-28 16:20:02'),(273,'MCHONG','Wee ni mrough hadi ukiguza mouse comp inashow NEW HARDWARE DETECTED','2015-01-28 16:20:27'),(274,'MCHONG','Uko down hadi ulikuwa unafikiria Youtube ni contraceptive','2015-01-28 16:21:11'),(275,'MCHONG','Wee ni mu ugly hadi ukiwa mtoi mama yako alikuwa anakushow, kula ama nilete kioo','2015-01-28 16:21:25'),(276,'MCHONG','Uko na shoulders broad hadi ukidance helicopter unatake off','2015-01-28 16:21:44'),(277,'MCHONG','N