 when it pumps out to the body to squirt blood 30 feet','2015-01-28 17:50:53'),(349,'FUNFACTS','On average people fear spiders more than they do death','2015-01-28 17:51:10'),(350,'FUNFACTS','The strongest muscle in the body is the tongue','2015-01-28 17:51:45'),(351,'FUNFACTS','You can\'t kill yourself by holding your breath','2015-01-28 17:52:03'),(352,'FUNFACTS','Every time you lick a stamp, you\'re consuming 1/10 of a calorie','2015-01-28 17:52:37'),(353,'FUNFACTS','You are more likely to be killed by a champagne cork than by a poisonous spider','2015-01-28 17:52:55'),(354,'FUNFACTS','Right handed people live, on average, nine years longer than left handed people do','2015-01-28 17:53:15'),(355,'FUNFACTS','In ancient Egypt, Priests plucked every hair from their bodies, including their eyebrows and eyelashes','2015-01-28 17:53:40'),(356,'FUNFACTS','A crocodile cannot stick its tongue out','2015-01-28 17:54:01'),(357,'FUNFACTS','The ant can lift 50 times its own weight, can pull 30 times its own weight and always falls over on its right side when intoxicated','2015-01-28 17:54:14'),(358,'FUNFACTS','Polar bears are left handed','2015-01-28 17:54:35'),(359,'FUNFACTS','The catfish has over 27,000 taste buds. That makes the catfish #1 for the animal having the most taste buds','2015-01-28 17:55:01'),(360,'FUNFACTS','The flea can jump 350 times its body length. It\'s like a human jumping the length of a football field','2015-01-28 17:55:37'),(361,'FUNFACTS','A cockroach will live nine days without its head, before it starves to death','2015-01-28 17:56:01'),(362,'FUNFACTS','Some lions mate over 50 times a day','2015-01-28 17:56:15'),(363,'FUNFACTS','Butterflies taste with their feet','2015-01-28 17:56:32'),(364,'FUNFACTS','A cat\'s urine glows under a blacklight','2015-01-28 17:56:53'),(365,'FUNFACTS','Starfish don\'t have brains','2015-01-28 17:57:07'),(366,'FUNFACTS','A quarter of the bones in your body are actually in your feet, seeing as each foot has 26 of the 206